Note on Derived Web Frontend Distribution:
The web frontend (`web/`) incorporates cartographic projection, hydrography,
neutral landmass outlines, and shaded-relief terrain adapted from
`DeanChensj/jiangshan-map` (commit `a9cd67c3c4c5eef5902d31104df9b5a7ec83aa0e`)
under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0). Accordingly, the combined
frontend distribution is provided under GPL-3.0; see `LICENSE-GPL-3.0.txt` and
`THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` for full license terms and source attribution.
